Description: native GTK4 desktop app to manage AI coding agent sessions
 Agent Tablet browses every AI coding-agent session (Claude Code,
 Cursor, …) on your machine in a sidebar grouped by project, lets you name and
 star them, and resumes any of them in embedded terminal tabs.
 .
 It is an unofficial community tool, not affiliated with Anthropic, and never
 modifies the agents' own session data.
